    {
      "name": "Bleeding Nail",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "If the hellcrown hits with a nail Strike, the target must attempt a DC 16 Fortitude save. On a failure, the nail is embedded in the creature, making it enfeebled|CRB|enfeebled 1 for 1 minute and giving it 1 persistent bleed damage (enfeebled|CRB|enfeebled 2 and 1d4 persistent bleed damage on a critical failure). Each additional embedded nail increases the enfeebled value by 1 (to a maximum of enfeebled|CRB|enfeebled 4) and the bleed damage by 1. A creature can remove a nail with an Interact action to reduce the enfeeblement and amount of bleed damage. Pulling out the last nail removes both conditions."
      ],
      "save": {
        "defense": "fortitude",
        "dc": 16,
        "basic": false,
        "outcomes": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Terrifying Stare",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [
        "fear",
        "mental",
        "visual"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "All creatures that can see the hellcrown and are suffering from its bleeding nail must attempt a DC 16 Will saving throw. A creature that fails is frightened|CRB|frightened 1, and on a critical failure becomes fleeing for as long as it's frightened. Any creature that attempts a save is then temporarily immune for 10 minutes."
      ],
      "save": {
        "defense": "will",
